data.vbt and dgpu-vbios.rom are ASUS/Intel and NVIDIA copyrighted binaries
extracted from the factory firmware. Document what they are, which Kconfig
options reference them, and how to extract them from ones own stock image.

Kept on this branch rather than only on the published one, so it survives
regeneration of the blob-stripped export branch.
